---
// Why Choose Us Section
---
<section class="py-24 bg-midnight text-offwhite">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <div class="order-2 md:order-1">
         <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-serif font-bold mb-6">
          Why Choose <span class="text-gold">Stoms Studios?</span>
        </h2>
        <ul class="space-y-4">
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="text-gold mr-3 mt-1 text-lg">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="block text-offwhite text-lg">Expert Trainers & Producers</strong>
              <span class="text-sm text-offwhite/60">We have professional choir trainers and music producers to help you sound your best.</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="text-gold mr-3 mt-1 text-lg">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="block text-offwhite text-lg">Talented Instrumentalists</strong>
              <span class="text-sm text-offwhite/60">Live instrumentation available for your recording or event.</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="text-gold mr-3 mt-1 text-lg">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="block text-offwhite text-lg">Top-Tier Equipment</strong>
              <span class="text-sm text-offwhite/60">From cameras to drones and audio gear, we invest in quality.</span>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start">
            <span class="text-gold mr-3 mt-1 text-lg">✓</span>
            <div>
              <strong class="block text-offwhite text-lg">Convenient Kitui Location</strong>
              <span class="text-sm text-offwhite/60">Find us easily at Kilungya Street, opposite Parkside Hotel.</span>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="order-1 md:order-2 relative h-[450px] rounded-sm overflow-hidden">
         <img src="/images/hero-choir.jpg" alt="Recording session at Stoms Studios" class="w-full h-full object-cover object-top" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>